  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T01:53:56.637645Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T02:02:39.136566Z",
  "totalBlocks": 31,
  "translatedBlocks": 31,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f87722486783fc19",
      "translationZh": "你是否觉得很难判断一段文本是由人类撰写的，还是由 AI 生成的？能够识别 AI 生成的内容，对于增进人们对信息的信任，以及帮助解决归属错误和错误信息等问题至关重要。今天，Google DeepMind 和 Hugging Face 很高兴宣布，将在今天晚些时候发布的 Transformers v4.46.0 中推出 SynthID Text。这项技术让你能够在生成任务中使用 logits 处理器为 AI 生成的文本添加水印，并通过分类器检测这些水印。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90d3f1a6f547fa84",
      "translationZh": "如需了解该算法的完整技术细节，请参阅发表于 Nature 的 SynthID Text 论文；如需进一步了解如何在你的产品中应用 SynthID Text，请参阅 Google 的 Responsible GenAI Toolkit。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c29169497e13a78",
      "translationZh": "SynthID Text 的主要目标是将水印编码到 AI 生成的文本中，帮助你判断文本是否由你的 LLM 生成，同时不影响底层 LLM 的工作方式，也不对生成质量产生负面影响。Google DeepMind 开发了一种水印技术，使用一种称为 g-function 的伪随机函数来增强任何 LLM 的生成过程，使水印无法被人类察觉，却能被训练过的模型识别。这项技术已被实现为一个生成工具，通过 model.generate() API，无需修改即可兼容任何 LLM，同时还提供了一个端到端示例，展示如何训练检测器来识别带水印的文本。请参阅研究论文，了解 SynthID Text 算法更完整的细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "06ac8948b3204bd4",
      "translationZh": "配置水印",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09b8b141615ab574",
      "translationZh": "水印通过一个 dataclass 进行配置，该数据类对 g-function 及其在锦标赛采样过程中的应用方式进行参数化。你使用的每个模型都应有自己的水印配置，并且应以安全、私密的方式存储，否则他人可能复制你的水印。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1185f6af044faee4",
      "translationZh": "你必须在每个水印配置中定义两个参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90eba5da7eade496",
      "translationZh": "keys 参数是一个整数列表，用于计算模型词汇表中各项的 g-function 分数。建议使用 20 到 30 个互不相同、随机生成的数字，以平衡可检测性与生成质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "634270a3bd38704e",
      "translationZh": "ngram_len 参数用于平衡鲁棒性与可检测性；值越大，水印就越容易被检测到，代价是对文本改动更加敏感。5 是一个不错的默认值，但该值至少需要为 2。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "316a8eb8460009e3",
      "translationZh": "你可以根据性能需求进一步配置水印。更多信息请参阅 SynthIDTextWatermarkingConfig 类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1544ec2f78dff306",
      "translationZh": "这篇研究论文还进一步分析了具体配置值如何影响水印性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "186eb786a1f5bba3",
      "translationZh": "添加水印",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "513ca7166c120fed",
      "translationZh": "只需对现有的生成调用做一个简单改动，即可添加水印。定义好配置后，将一个 SynthIDTextWatermarkingConfig 对象作为 watermarking_config= 参数传入 model.generate()，所有生成的文本就都会带有水印。前往 SynthID Text Space 查看水印添加的交互式示例，看看你能否分辨出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "54b026248a42a32b",
      "translationZh": "检测水印",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f7b597eb3cefa2",
      "translationZh": "水印的设计目标是让经过训练的分类器能够检测到它，而人类无法察觉。你在模型中使用的每一种水印配置，都需要有一个经过训练、能够识别该水印的检测器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "185aa4d410ab3ceb",
      "translationZh": "检测器的基本训练流程如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60e9004fc09eb285",
      "translationZh": "确定水印配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6632bb0c2daea77",
      "translationZh": "收集检测器训练数据集，按是否带水印以及训练集或测试集进行划分，我们建议至少收集 10k 个示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd669b589c01c522",
      "translationZh": "使用你的模型生成不带水印的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95e00160f7fda020",
      "translationZh": "使用你的模型生成带水印的输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "199fbc1d5ec47ed2",
      "translationZh": "训练你的水印检测分类器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0113d5271a2fd118",
      "translationZh": "将你的模型连同水印配置和配套检测器一起部署到生产环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f948d6705a50b337",
      "translationZh": "Transformers 提供了一个贝叶斯检测器类，以及一个端到端示例，展示如何训练检测器，使其识别使用特定水印配置生成的带水印文本。使用相同分词器的模型还可以共享水印配置和检测器，从而共享同一种水印，前提是检测器的训练集包含来自所有共享该水印的模型的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34a149a328354faa",
      "translationZh": "可以将这个训练好的检测器上传到私有 HF Hub，使整个组织都能访问它。Google 的 Responsible GenAI Toolkit 提供了更多关于如何在你的产品中将 SynthID Text 部署到生产环境的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69b1b67de5ef98be",
      "translationZh": "局限性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "633b15fe54afcbb9",
      "translationZh": "SynthID Text 水印对某些文本变换具有稳健性，例如裁剪部分文本、修改少量词语或轻度改写，但这种方法确实存在局限性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c53758493c325256",
      "translationZh": "在事实性回答中，添加水印的效果较差，因为在不降低准确性的前提下调整生成过程的空间较小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37d70c5804cffc20",
      "translationZh": "当 AI 生成的文本被彻底重写或翻译成另一种语言时，检测器的置信度分数可能会大幅降低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ed1cce3dc7ed051",
      "translationZh": "SynthID Text 并非为直接阻止蓄意实施危害的对抗者而设计。不过，它可以增加将 AI 生成内容用于恶意目的的难度，也可以与其他方法结合，更好地覆盖各种内容类型和平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c9015d53b9084645",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b527af4e8a20523",
      "translationZh": "作者感谢 Robert Stanforth 和 Tatiana Matejovicova 对这项工作的贡献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
